      "writtenOn": "2019-10-04T21:09:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CONFIG_BOOT_KEYS is on by default.  No need to explicitly add here.\n\nCONFIG_KEYBOARD_KEYPAD configures the key scanning over 15 column pins instead of just 13 pins.  Since Volteer has 15 pins, a keyboard with keypad can be supported.  Add CONFIG_KEYBOARD_KEYPAD so all signals are scanned.",
